        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*INTERNAL PHOTOS TO FOLLOW*\n\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 10 Grove Court to the market, a superb one-bedroom, one-bathroom penthouse apartment with a South-East wraparound balcony, ideally situated in the highly regarded Grove Court development, Blanchardstown. The property enjoys a prime position close to an impressive range of amenities, with Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Blanchardstown Courthouse and Connolly Hospital all within easy reach. Coolmine Train Station is approximately a 20-minute walk away, while multiple bus routes are available right on your doorstep, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The apartment is ideally situated for everyday convenience, with a wealth of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities all nearby. Excellent access to the M50 and N3 road networks further enhances the location.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 60 sq m, this property boasts an entrance hallway with storage closet and hot press, and further leads to the spacious open plan living/dining room with fully fitted kitchen. The spacious master bedroom benefits from direct access to the main family bathroom, adding an extra level of convenience and practicality. The property externally benefits of a SOUTH EAST wrap around balcony perfect for relaxing.\n\nNo. 10 Grove court is presented in great condition throughout and has been meticulously maintained throughout the years. The long list of additional features includes electric storage heaters, South East wraparound balcony, excellent location, designated underground parking with lift/ stairs access.  Early viewing is highly advised, enquire today at Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nFeatures:\n 1 BED / 1 BATH Penthouse Apartment\n Wraparound Balcony with South East facing\n Lift and stairs access\n Designated underground parking\n c. 60 sq m\n D1 BER rating\n Secure development\n Built in storage throughout\n Management fees c. 2,400 per annum\n Blanchardstown Shopping centre at your doorstep\n Coolmine Train station c. 20 min walk\n Within easy reach M50 Motorway & N3\n Primary and secondary schools in close proximity\n Ideal for first time buyers and investors\n Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections:\n\nWhen driving from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, take the right turn on the roundabout onto Snugborough Road. Take the 2nd right turn on Grove Road and keep driving straight towards the parking lot. You will see the entrance to the court house adjacent to the main door."
      },
